{"id":"84d29f643f27eadc","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-thresholdpolarity.md","title":"Weight signs, dummy coordinates, and switching","display":"thm-thresholdpolarity — Weight signs, dummy coordinates, and switching","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-thresholdpolarity","aliases":["27-thm-thresholdpolarity"],"display":"thm-thresholdpolarity — Weight signs, dummy coordinates, and switching","depends_on":["[[27-df-threshold]]","[[27-df-variablepolarity]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§9.2 Theorem 9.6","source_printed_pages":"409–410","source_pdf_pages":"433–434","verification_status":"source-statement-and-coordinate-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-thresholdpolarity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-thresholdpolarity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-thresholdpolarity — Weight signs, dummy coordinates, and switching"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3413562300b98864\" href=\"?note=3413562300b98864\" title=\"27-df-variablepolarity\">27-df-variablepolarity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.2 Theorem 9.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"409–410"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"433–434"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-coordinate-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)\">\\((w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[n]\">\\(i\\in[n]\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a>。布尔坐标更新 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x[i\\leftarrow b]\">\\(x[i\\leftarrow b]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3413562300b98864\" href=\"?note=3413562300b98864\" title=\"27-df-variablepolarity\">27-df-variablepolarity</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ess}_i(f),\\mathrm{Pos}_i(f),\\mathrm{Neg}_i(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ess}_i(f),\\mathrm{Pos}_i(f),\\mathrm{Neg}_i(f)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\subseteq[n]\">\\(N\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w^{i\\leftarrow0}\\in\\mathbb R^n\">\\(w^{i\\leftarrow0}\\in\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_N:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B^n\">\\(\\sigma_N:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B^n\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(g:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N\\coloneqq\\{j\\in[n]\\mid w_j&lt;0\\},\\qquad(w^{i\\leftarrow0})_j\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;j=i,\\\\w_j&amp;j\\ne i\\end{cases}\\quad(j\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N\\coloneqq\\{j\\in[n]\\mid w_j&lt;0\\},\\qquad(w^{i\\leftarrow0})_j\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;j=i,\\\\w_j&amp;j\\ne i\\end{cases}\\quad(j\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ess}_i(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x[i\\leftarrow0])\\ne f(x[i\\leftarrow1])).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ess}_i(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x[i\\leftarrow0])\\ne f(x[i\\leftarrow1])).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pos}_i(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x[i\\leftarrow0])\\le f(x[i\\leftarrow1])),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Neg}_i(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x[i\\leftarrow0])\\ge f(x[i\\leftarrow1])).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Pos}_i(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x[i\\leftarrow0])\\le f(x[i\\leftarrow1])),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Neg}_i(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x[i\\leftarrow0])\\ge f(x[i\\leftarrow1])).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w_i=0\\Rightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Ess}_i(f),\\qquad\n\\neg\\mathrm{Ess}_i(f)\\Rightarrow(w^{i\\leftarrow0},t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w_i=0\\Rightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Ess}_i(f),\\qquad\n\\neg\\mathrm{Ess}_i(f)\\Rightarrow(w^{i\\leftarrow0},t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w_i&gt;0\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Pos}_i(f),\\quad w_i&lt;0\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Neg}_i(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w_i&gt;0\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Pos}_i(f),\\quad w_i&lt;0\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Neg}_i(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ess}_i(f)\\land\\mathrm{Pos}_i(f)\\Rightarrow w_i&gt;0,\\quad\n\\mathrm{Ess}_i(f)\\land\\mathrm{Neg}_i(f)\\Rightarrow w_i&lt;0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ess}_i(f)\\land\\mathrm{Pos}_i(f)\\Rightarrow w_i&gt;0,\\quad\n\\mathrm{Ess}_i(f)\\land\\mathrm{Neg}_i(f)\\Rightarrow w_i&lt;0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\sigma_N(x))_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1-x_i&amp;i\\in N,\\\\x_i&amp;i\\notin N,\\end{cases}\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ i\\in[n]),\\qquad g\\coloneqq f\\circ\\sigma_N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\sigma_N(x))_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1-x_i&amp;i\\in N,\\\\x_i&amp;i\\notin N,\\end{cases}\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ i\\in[n]),\\qquad g\\coloneqq f\\circ\\sigma_N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left((|w_i|)_{i\\in[n]},t-\\sum_{i\\in N}w_i\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(g),\\qquad\n\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(\\left(\\forall j\\in[n]\\;x_j\\le y_j\\right)\\Rightarrow g(x)\\le g(y)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left((|w_i|)_{i\\in[n]},t-\\sum_{i\\in N}w_i\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(g),\\qquad\n\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(\\left(\\forall j\\in[n]\\;x_j\\le y_j\\right)\\Rightarrow g(x)\\le g(y)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 9.6，印刷 pp.409–410／PDF pp.433–434。相邻坐标得分差恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_i\">\\(w_i\\)</span>，给出正负性与本质变量的逆向符号。若变量虚设，归零后的输出等于原函数在该坐标置0的输出。开关恒等式为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\cdot\\sigma_N(x)=\\sum_{i\\in N}w_i+\\sum_i|w_i|x_i\">\\(w\\cdot\\sigma_N(x)=\\sum_{i\\in N}w_i+\\sum_i|w_i|x_i\\)</span>。未声称每个结构中虚变量都零权。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-threshold]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-variablepolarity","status":"resolved","id":"3413562300b98864","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-variablepolarity]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$，$(w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)$，$i\\in[n]$；见 [[27-df-threshold]]。布尔坐标更新 $x[i\\leftarrow b]$ 见 [[27-df-variablepolarity]]。$\\mathrm{Ess}_i(f),\\mathrm{Pos}_i(f),\\mathrm{Neg}_i(f)$、$N\\subseteq[n]$、$w^{i\\leftarrow0}\\in\\mathbb R^n$、$\\sigma_N:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B^n$ 与 $g:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B$ 由下式定义。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-variablepolarity","status":"resolved","id":"3413562300b98864","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$，$(w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)$，$i\\in[n]$；见 [[27-df-threshold]]。布尔坐标更新 $x[i\\leftarrow b]$ 见 [[27-df-variablepolarity]]。$\\mathrm{Ess}_i(f),\\mathrm{Pos}_i(f),\\mathrm{Neg}_i(f)$、$N\\subseteq[n]$、$w^{i\\leftarrow0}\\in\\mathbb R^n$、$\\sigma_N:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B^n$ 与 $g:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B$ 由下式定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n","display":false},{"tex":"(w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"x[i\\leftarrow b]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ess}_i(f),\\mathrm{Pos}_i(f),\\mathrm{Neg}_i(f)","display":false},{"tex":"N\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"w^{i\\leftarrow0}\\in\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_N:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"N\\coloneqq\\{j\\in[n]\\mid w_j<0\\},\\qquad(w^{i\\leftarrow0})_j\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&j=i,\\\\w_j&j\\ne i\\end{cases}\\quad(j\\in[n]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ess}_i(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x[i\\leftarrow0])\\ne f(x[i\\leftarrow1])).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pos}_i(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x[i\\leftarrow0])\\le f(x[i\\leftarrow1])),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Neg}_i(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x[i\\leftarrow0])\\ge f(x[i\\leftarrow1])).","display":true},{"tex":"w_i=0\\Rightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Ess}_i(f),\\qquad\n\\neg\\mathrm{Ess}_i(f)\\Rightarrow(w^{i\\leftarrow0},t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f).","display":true},{"tex":"w_i>0\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Pos}_i(f),\\quad w_i<0\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Neg}_i(f).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ess}_i(f)\\land\\mathrm{Pos}_i(f)\\Rightarrow w_i>0,\\quad\n\\mathrm{Ess}_i(f)\\land\\mathrm{Neg}_i(f)\\Rightarrow w_i<0.","display":true},{"tex":"(\\sigma_N(x))_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1-x_i&i\\in N,\\\\x_i&i\\notin N,\\end{cases}\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ i\\in[n]),\\qquad g\\coloneqq f\\circ\\sigma_N.","display":true},{"tex":"\\left((|w_i|)_{i\\in[n]},t-\\sum_{i\\in N}w_i\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(g),\\qquad\n\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(\\left(\\forall j\\in[n]\\;x_j\\le y_j\\right)\\Rightarrow g(x)\\le g(y)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"w_i","display":false},{"tex":"w\\cdot\\sigma_N(x)=\\sum_{i\\in N}w_i+\\sum_i|w_i|x_i","display":false}],"bytes":2667,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-thresholdpolarity|thm-thresholdpolarity — Weight signs, dummy coordinates, and switching]]"}],"outgoing":["d0db491e5f6359f5","3413562300b98864"]}